  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Every record here is in `ccbgssse025-advdsgs.esm`. The AtrForge copies template the base saints for traits and inventory but not `Stats` or `BaseData`, so they own their level and name. The summon-only copies (plain, AtrForge-as-summon, Thoron's) are on *Daedric Summons*.",
      "The summons `ccBGSSSE025_EncSummonGoldenSaintArcher` 095E1F, `…Warrior` 095E20, `ccBGSSSE025_EncSummonDarkSeducerArcher` 095E21, `…Warrior` 095E22 (level 18) and Thoron's summons `…ArcherBoss` / `…WarriorBoss` 0BE6B2 · 0BE6B3 · 0BE6B4 · 0BE6B5 (PC × 0.75 [18–80]) use the base saints as templates but set their own level, so changing a base record does not move them.",
      "`ccBGSSSE025_EncSummonStaada` 19D3FD (the summon, level 42; on *Daedric Summons*) uses `ccBGSSSE025_Staada` 198273 as its template but sets its own level, so changing Staada does not move it. `…StaadaHostile` templates 19D3FD, also without `Stats`.",
      "The AtrForge rows, `ccBGSSSE025_EncSummonStaadaHostile`: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other record of the family (the `ccBGSSSE025_LvlSummon{GoldenSaint,DarkSeducer}AtrForge` wrappers) carries `Stats` and follows its list."
    ]
  },
